# Output Quality Improvement (MVP)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-output-quality.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-output-quality.md)

## Goal

Communicate Care Reality understanding — not AI message analysis.  
Events → Relationships → Understanding → Confidence.

## Must

- Recognition first (situation-grounded — never therapy empathy)  
- Human language only (ban care signal / memory anchor / care state / engine jargon in caregiver UI)  
- Make connections to prior care story visible for returning users  
- Surface decision **why** when decisions are held  
- Separate known / unclear / what would improve understanding  
- What matters now = most important next understanding (not echo / checklist)  

## Never

Chatbot empathy · false certainty · diagnosis · summarizing as the product · hardcoded scenarios
